<title>USA: Toastmaster drops environmental products.</title>
<headline>Toastmaster drops environmental products.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Mo 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toastmaster Inc on Thursday said it planned to dispose of its environmental products line as part of its broad restructuring.</p>
